<title>AUSTRIA: Nigeria's Etete sees no impact from Iraqi exports.</title>
<headline>Nigeria's Etete sees no impact from Iraqi exports.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nigerian oil minister Dan Etete said on Tuesday he expected no impact whatsoever from the return of Iraqi oil to the market.</p>
<p>&quot;There will be no impact whatsoever,&quot; he said.</p>
<p>&quot;It's not a suprise, the market has discounted already, they can come back today it would make no difference,&quot; Etete added.</p>
<p>-- Vienna Newsroom +431 713 2034</p>
